.TH "SCCFM-CLI CONFIGURE" "1" "2026-08-18" "0.39.0" "sccfm-cli configure Manual"
.SH NAME
sccfm-cli\-configure \- Configure API connectivity.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sccfm-cli configure
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure API connectivity.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\-path\fP PATH
Path to the configuration file (defaults to ~/.sccfm-cli/config.json).
.TP
\fB\-\-region\fP [int|us|eu|apj|au|uae|in|ci|aus]
SCCFM region (int, us, eu, apj, au, uae, in, ci)  [required]
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-token\fP TEXT
API token for the chosen region  [required]
